<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now there are choices</l><l>Now there are choices</l><l>And ev’ry day—so many choices I must make.</l><l>Shall I stay or shall I go?</l><l>Shall I say “yes,” or is it “no?”</l><l>The choice is mine in what I do and what I say.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I have a free will</l><l>To make my choices.</l><l>What will I do with this responsibility?</l><l>If I can choose just to obey</l><l>Whatever older ones might say.</l><l>That’s what I’ll do with this responsibility!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
